  "confidence": "high",
  "notes": "PC: magicgameworld and gamenguides agree. PS5: ludo.guide and outsidergaming agree (R1 hold hoverboots, L3 sprint, L1 Rift Tether/Swingshot, Circle Phantom Dash, Triangle hold weapon wheel / tap last weapon / interact, R3 objective, Touchpad map). PC binds both sprint and hoverboots to LShift, so LShift sends L3+R1; C sends sprint only. PC 'Weapon Select: Mouse Wheel' is taken as holding the wheel button (MOUSE3). Shortcuts are mapped by direction (PC arrows to D-pad). The slot numbers differ between sources (PC: 2 = Right, 4 = Left; ludo: 2 = Left, 4 = Right), and shortcuts are assigned per platform anyway. Not reproduced: weapon slots 1-8, next/previous weapon (mouse wheel), walk (LAlt). Interact on PS5 (Triangle) comes from outsidergaming only.",
